### Maven / Spring Boot ###
HELP.md
target/
!.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar
!**/src/main/**/target/
!**/src/test/**/target/
build/
!**/src/main/**/build/
!**/src/test/**/build/

### IDE ###
# IntelliJ IDEA
.idea/
*.iws
*.iml
*.ipr
# VS Code
.vscode/
# Eclipse / STS
.apt_generated
.classpath
.factorypath
.project
.settings
.springBeans
.sts4-cache
# NetBeans
/nbproject/private/
/nbbuild/
/dist/
/nbdist/
/.nb-gradle/

### Secrets et configuration locale ###
# Docker Compose
.env
# Terraform : état, providers, variables et backend réels
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/terraform.tfvars
**/backend.hcl
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log
# Ansible : Vault (chiffré ou non, jamais versionné), copies déchiffrées, runtime généré
platform/ansible/group_vars/devops/vault.yml
platform/ansible/group_vars/devops/vault.yml.dec
**/*.vault.dec
platform/ansible/group_vars/devops/runtime.yml
*.retry

### Rapports et journaux générés ###
*.log
trivy-*.txt
gitleaks-report.json


